.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-doctor 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-doctor \- Diagnose whether Batten can run in this repository
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten doctor\fR [\fB\-J\fR|\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Diagnose whether Batten can run in this repository
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-J\fR, \fB\-\-json\fR
Emit byte\-stable JSON instead of pointer lines
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-doctor\-hooks(1)
Diagnose whether batten is wired on every hook surface of every harness
.TP
batten\-doctor\-session(1)
Diagnose whether this session has declared work it has not finished
.TP
batten\-doctor\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
